   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Andrew<div><br></div><div>Sorry for bothering you.</div><div><br></div><div>When running <i>ldsc, </i>I always received the error message &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Error </span><span style=\"font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:rgb(186,45,162)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> setwd(ld) : cannot change working directory&quot;</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px;font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">here is the code and error message: </span></div><div><br></div><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">&gt; traits &lt;- c(</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;coleoptile.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;grain_yield.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;plant_height.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;protein.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;seedling_biomass.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">,</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;seed_size.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;tiller_number.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">,</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;zs49.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; sample.prev &lt;- c(NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; population.prev &lt;- c(NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">&gt; ld &lt;- </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;barley_ld/&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">&gt; wld &lt;- </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;barley_ld/&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">&gt; trait.names&lt;-c(</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;coleoptile&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;grain_yield&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;plant_height&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;protein&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">, </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;seedling_biomass&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">,</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;seed_size&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">,</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;tiller_number&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">,</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&quot;zs49&quot;</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#000000\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; LDSCoutput &lt;- ldsc(traits, sample.prev, population.prev, ld, wld, trait.names)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Error </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#ba2da2\">in</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> setwd(ld): cannot change working directory</span></p><div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">When i check the working directory, i had the following  (the &quot;barley_ld&quot; <span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">folder has the LD scores files, and &quot;gSEM&quot; folder has all the </span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">munged summary statistics)</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">&gt; getwd()<br></font></div><div><div><font size=\"2\">[1] &quot;/Users/218496f/Desktop/Barleytrait/gSEM/barley_ld&quot;</font></div></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">Anything wrong here? looking forward to hearing your advice. </font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">Thank you</font></div><div><font size=\"2\">Tianhua</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
