   "subject": "Re: Error in setwd(ld) : cannot change working directory",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Tianhua, <div><br></div><div>Thanks for your question! This error message pops up when the <i>ldsc </i>function is unable to find the location of your ld-score files, in your case &quot;barley_ld/&quot;. The way you have the code written,  those ld-score files would need to be a subdirectory within the working directory where your .sumstats.gz files are stored. Alternatively, you could write the specific path name to where the ld-score files are (e.g., &quot;~/Tianhua/Documents/barley_ld/&quot;. Let me know if this helps or if you have anymore questions!</div><div><br></div><div>-Andrew</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Tuesday, August 6, 2019 at 10:34:01 PM UTC-5, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tianh...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Andrew<div><br></div><div>Sorry for bothering you.</div><div><br></div><div>When running <i>ldsc, </i>I always received the error message &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px\">Error </span><span style=\"font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px;color:rgb(186,45,162)\">in</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px\"> setwd(ld) : cannot change working directory&quot;</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo;font-size:12px\">here is the code and error message: </span></div><div><br></div><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&gt; traits &lt;- c(</span><span>&quot;coleoptile.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;grain_yield.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;plant_height.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;protein.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;seedling_biomass.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">,</span><span>&quot;seed_size.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;tiller_number.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">,</span><span>&quot;zs49.sumstats.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>&gt; sample.prev &lt;- c(NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>&gt; population.prev &lt;- c(NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA,NA)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&gt; ld &lt;- </span><span>&quot;barley_ld/&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&gt; wld &lt;- </span><span>&quot;barley_ld/&quot;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&gt; trait.names&lt;-c(</span><span>&quot;coleoptile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;grain_yield&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;plant_height&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;protein&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">, </span><span>&quot;seedling_biomass&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">,</span><span>&quot;seed_size&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">,</span><span>&quot;tiller_number&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">,</span><span>&quot;zs49&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>&gt; LDSCoutput &lt;- ldsc(traits, sample.prev, population.prev, ld, wld, trait.names)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>Error </span><span style=\"color:#ba2da2\">in</span><span> setwd(ld): cannot change working directory</span></p><div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">When i check the working directory, i had the following  (the &quot;barley_ld&quot; <span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">folder has the LD scores files, and &quot;gSEM&quot; folder has all the </span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">munged summary statistics)</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">&gt; getwd()<br></font></div><div><div><font size=\"2\">[1] &quot;/Users/218496f/Desktop/Barleytrait/gSEM/barley_ld&quot;</font></div></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">Anything wrong here? looking forward to hearing your advice. </font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\">Thank you</font></div><div><font size=\"2\">Tianhua</font></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
