     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Andrew,<div><br></div><div>Thank you for your prompt and useful advice.</div><div><br></div><div>your suggestion of writting the specific path name to where the ld-score files are did the trick. here is the code i used:</div><div><br></div><div><div>&gt; ld &lt;- &quot;/Users/Tianhua/Desktop/Barleytrait/gSEM/barley_ld&quot;</div><div>&gt; wld &lt;-&quot;/Users/Tianhua/Desktop/Barleytrait/gSEM/barley_ld&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks again</div><div>Tianhua</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
